# Base URL of the Directus CMS that feeds the Selected Work grid (#works).
# Leave UNSET in prod: the site defaults to the same-origin "/directus" path,
# which nginx proxies to the Directus container (see nginx.conf) — no CORS or
# public CMS subdomain needed. Set this only to point at a different/absolute
# Directus (e.g. a local instance during dev). Empty base disables the grid
# (neutral placeholder tiles).
# VITE_DIRECTUS_URL=/directus
